# data/chunks/ is NOT ignored: the Docker build reads chunks.jsonl and the
# embedding cache out of the build context, so a fresh clone has to carry
# them or `docker build` has nothing to index. ~1.2 MB, and it makes the
# image reproducible without a crawl.
